// Recovered model: the Workbench layout (48 ivars, offsets 100..320).
//
// Generated by tools/gen_layout_model.py from the binary's own OBJC_IVAR_$_Workbench.* table, so the offsets are the
// runtime's numbers rather than measurements. anchors are the offsets the LIVE probe printed from the running game's own ivar table, so they check the static table against the runtime rather than restating it.
